      // ---- the Drowned Cove -------------------------------------------
      //
      // Three slimes with three ways of reaching the player, because a floor
      // whose whole roster closes to arm's length teaches nothing the first
      // five have not already taught. Between them they cover the three
      // answers the game has: stand somewhere else, get out of the ring, and
      // kill it before it arrives.
      //
